# Generated figures ARE committed: they plot aggregates only (counts, rates,
# curves) and are the visual half of the reports. The CI hash-scan gate is what
# actually enforces that no row-level data reaches a tracked file -- see
# .github/workflows/tests.yml. Never commit a figure that plots or labels
# individual sessions, SKUs or URLs.

